歡的那種。\n\n二訪鹹蛋黃金沙拉麵，色澤跟豚骨拉麵相比偏黃，味道也是很濃郁好喝的那種湯頭，推薦可以嘗試！\n\n此外，推薦唐揚炸雞塊跟金翠腐乳泡菜，非常好吃！\n\n最後要讚美一下，店面冷氣開好開滿，再搭配店家準備的冰涼涼檸檬水，讓人在炎炎夏日裡感到好涼快！",null,[0,104]]]],[null,1721649455000000,1721649455000000,"2 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQm04REhVWUVfdkZtbmtrdkFBTDE4dw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfQm04REhVWUVfdkZtbmtrdkFBTDE4dxoSQ2dzSXI1TDV0QVlRaUpfRFdR\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwizgZeYx9KWAxV6ZvUHHQeDEN0Q_2MI9AEoCQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/601616323475710245/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmlORXcyUTBSQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/601616323475710245/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmlORXcyUTBSQkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/601616323475710245/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmlORXcyUTBSQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/601616323475710245/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmlORXcyUTBSQkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/601616323475710245/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmlORXcyUTBSQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/601616323475710245/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTmlORXcyUTBSQkVBRRAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["能讓您滿意真的是太高興了，您的肯定是我們進步的最大動力，感謝您的支持~",null,[0,35]]]],[null,null,7673,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNiNEw2Q0RBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xde2b9036b6c97687!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICb4L6CDA%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNiNEw2Q0RBEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNiNEw2Q0RBEi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ2I0TDZDakFFEhNDZ3dJN3BDT3RRWVFrTjJobWdFGiwKFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ2I0TDZDVEESEkNnc0lwNXI0dEFZUS1OU1hNQSISCQAAAAAAAAAAEYd2ybY2kCveKgswYWNzWHFxa05XNw\u0026wv\u003d1\